<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective July 24-30:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 65.37</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 69.62</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 71.58</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 75.18</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$175.15</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$131.36</p>
<p>   Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 97.66</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 25.40</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.54</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 28.02</p>
</text>
